    "answerImage": "",
    "solutionText": "<b>Решение:</b>\n<b>Правильная цепочка:</b>\n<b><span style=\"color:red\">2</span></b> <span style=\"display:inline-block; text-align:center;\"><span style=\"display:block; font-size:10px;\">^2</span><span style=\"display:block;\">→</span></span> <b>2^2</b> <span style=\"display:inline-block; text-align:center;\"><span style=\"display:block; font-size:10px;\">+b</span><span style=\"display:block;\">→</span></span> <b>2^2+b</b> <span style=\"display:inline-block; text-align:center;\"><span style=\"display:block; font-size:10px;\">+b</span><span style=\"display:block;\">→</span></span> <b>2^2+b+b</b> <span style=\"display:inline-block; text-align:center;\"><span style=\"display:block; font-size:10px;\">^2</span><span style=\"display:block;\">→</span></span> <b>(2^2+b+b)^2</b> <span style=\"display:inline-block; text-align:center;\"><span style=\"display:block; font-size:10px;\">+b</span><span style=\"display:block;\">→</span></span> <b><span style=\"color:red\">(2^2+b+b)^2+b = 37</span></b>\nУравнение:\n(<b>2</b>^<b>2</b> + <b>b</b> + <b>b</b>)^<b>2</b> + <b>b</b> = <b><span style=\"color:red\">37</span></b>\nПри <b>b</b> = <b>1</b>: (<b>4</b> + <b>2</b>)^<b>2</b> + <b>1</b> = <b>36</b> + <b>1</b> = <b>37</b> ✅\n<b>b</b> = <b>1</b>",
