    "answerImage": "",
    "solutionText": "<b>Решение:</b>\n<b>Правильная цепочка:</b>\n<b><span style=\"color:red\">50</span></b> <span style=\"display:inline-block; text-align:center;\"><span style=\"display:block; font-size:10px;\">+2</span><span style=\"display:block;\">→</span></span> <b>50+2</b> <span style=\"display:inline-block; text-align:center;\"><span style=\"display:block; font-size:10px;\">+2</span><span style=\"display:block;\">→</span></span> <b>50+2+2</b> <span style=\"display:inline-block; text-align:center;\"><span style=\"display:block; font-size:10px;\">/b</span><span style=\"display:block;\">→</span></span> <b>(50+2+2)/b</b> <span style=\"display:inline-block; text-align:center;\"><span style=\"display:block; font-size:10px;\">+2</span><span style=\"display:block;\">→</span></span> <b>(50+2+2)/b+2</b> <span style=\"display:inline-block; text-align:center;\"><span style=\"display:block; font-size:10px;\">+2</span><span style=\"display:block;\">→</span></span> <b><span style=\"color:red\">(50+2+2)/b+2+2 = 22</span></b>\nУравнение:\n(<b>50</b> + <b>2</b> + <b>2</b>) / <b>b</b> + <b>2</b> + <b>2</b> = <b><span style=\"color:red\">22</span></b>\n<b>54</b> / <b>b</b> + <b>4</b> = <b>22</b>\n<b>54</b> / <b>b</b> = <b>18</b>\n<b>b</b> = <b>3</b>",
